  "line": "Your ChatGPT gives you generic answers.",
  "start": 0.3,
  "end": 3.69
 },
 {
  "n": 2,
  "line": "Not because it's dumb. Nobody told it how to think .",
  "start": 3.52,
  "end": 7.28
 },
 {
  "n": 3,
  "line": "One block of text. Pasted once .",
  "start": 7.62,
  "end": 10.66
 },
 {
  "n": 4,
  "line": "Then it picks its own reasoning \u2014 every chat.",
  "start": 10.92,
  "end": 14.46
 },
 {
  "n": 5,
  "line": "Open Settings .",
  "start": 14.98,
  "end": 16.21
 },
 {
